      "type":"verse",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"They feelin' kinda jealous, everybody be thinkin’ that they was cool",
          "rhyme":"ul",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"Gettin' money since my mommy was droppin' me off at school",
          "rhyme":"ul",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"Now I got a whip to cruise in",
          "rhyme":"in",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"You the Pirates so you losin’, I'm in the news, you let 'em bring your news in",
          "rhyme":"in",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"I bowl strikes, you always leavin' a few pins",
          "rhyme":")",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"I do me, you keepin' up with them new trends",
          "rhyme":"#",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"I got fam, you worried 'bout makin' new friends",
          "rhyme":"#",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"I'm in my PJs, you had to wear your suit in",
          "rhyme":"in",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"Thinkin' what I'll do? When? Where? How? Why me?",
          "rhyme":"@",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"Relax myself, kick it like Tai Chi",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"You could find me, only where I’m at",
          "rhyme":"a",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"11",
          "text":"There ain't no other me's, they be checkin' on my stats",
          "rhyme":"a",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"12",
          "text":"High cat, find 'im up in a tree",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"13",
          "text":"Homie may be spittin' bars, he ain't fuckin with me",
          "rhyme":"@",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"14",
          "text":"I'm just turnin' up the heat to a hunnid degrees",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"15",
          "text":"Spittin' like I got a razor blade stuck to my teeth, hey",
          "rhyme":"E",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        }
